cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite them using the metadata below, and credit OpenStreetMap as described in the README."
title: "osm-govan-static: A static Wikibase of OpenStreetMap features at Govan Old with version history, anchored in CIDOC CRM"
abstract: >-
  A static, read-only Wikibase on GitHub Pages for the OpenStreetMap features around Govan Old in Glasgow (church, churchyard, historic objects, museum). Each OSM element is one item, its version history is kept as statements, its geometry as WKT, and every item is anchored on a CIDOC CRM class. Built with wikibase-static.
type: software
